{"4890170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tank Mates", "steam_appid": 4890170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/3f228dd057991126a8d14cb39e9dd6ee.avif?t=1788149082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras_big/3f228dd057991126a8d14cb39e9dd6ee.webp?t=1788149082 width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/1b5b9c5eaa50b81ad116964a2b5f14c6.poster.avif?t=1788149082\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/1b5b9c5eaa50b81ad116964a2b5f14c6.webm?t=1788149082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/1b5b9c5eaa50b81ad116964a2b5f14c6.mp4?t=1788149082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to <strong>Tank Mates</strong>, where teamwork isn't optional—it's survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Control a single tank together as you battle through a brutal military obstacle course packed with deadly traps, impossible jumps, enemy tanks, and explosive surprises. Every movement, every jump, and every shot requires perfect coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">One mistake can send both of you flying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">One victory feels legendary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether you're playing online, on the couch, or taking on the challenge alone, prepare for spectacular failures, clutch saves, and the kind of laughter that only comes from complete chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/3da41c5a23b269b4f98fca42eab8b720.avif?t=1788149082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras_big/3da41c5a23b269b4f98fca42eab8b720.webp?t=1788149082 width=1560 height=146 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/19e875faf1f01c819dbd8c7449f1121a.poster.avif?t=1788149082\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/19e875faf1f01c819dbd8c7449f1121a.webm?t=1788149082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/19e875faf1f01c819dbd8c7449f1121a.mp4?t=1788149082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Forget everything you know about co-op games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong>Tank Mates</strong>, you don't each get your own vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You share one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">One player controls the left side. The other controls the right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Want to move forward?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Push together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Need to make a difficult jump?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Time it perfectly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trying to destroy an enemy tank?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Aim first. Panic later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The controls are simple to learn—but mastering them is another story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/33bd58ff63fb203452e98fbf66222131.avif?t=1788149082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras_big/33bd58ff63fb203452e98fbf66222131.webp?t=1788149082 width=1560 height=146 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/0ab8a804772ed0e9a4096c6478ede9f2.poster.avif?t=1788149082\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/0ab8a804772ed0e9a4096c6478ede9f2.webm?t=1788149082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/0ab8a804772ed0e9a4096c6478ede9f2.mp4?t=1788149082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The military obstacle course isn't here to help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It's here to test your teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight your way through increasingly dangerous environments filled with:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Rivers of lava</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Massive swinging hammers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explosive minefields</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Slippery oil-covered roads</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enemy tanks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Automated turrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Precision platforming challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every obstacle is designed to push your coordination, timing, and patience to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every checkpoint feels earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every failure is hilarious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/c72c44e8c0db458436e2c711be524ad0.avif?t=1788149082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras_big/c72c44e8c0db458436e2c711be524ad0.webp?t=1788149082 width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/0b5e8c32557a53945c841e9eb1726fc3.avif?t=1788149082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras_big/0b5e8c32557a53945c841e9eb1726fc3.webp?t=1788149082 width=1560 height=139 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Team up with a friend from anywhere and conquer the chaos together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/d2fbed91a84dd14359fb13eabed9c1dd.avif?t=1788149082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras_big/d2fbed91a84dd14359fb13eabed9c1dd.webp?t=1788149082 width=1560 height=139 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Share the same couch, the same tank... and probably the blame.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/6ace6082db5363801718840a6a9b7dd9.avif?t=1788149082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras_big/6ace6082db5363801718840a6a9b7dd9.webp?t=1788149082 width=1560 height=139 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Think you don't need a teammate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Control both sides of the tank yourself and discover a whole new level of challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/c772d5ab895786c15ecc611e80872271.avif?t=1788149082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras_big/c772d5ab895786c15ecc611e80872271.webp?t=1788149082 width=1560 height=146 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/7b9c85f739ab1189856e5022ebe80dcb.poster.avif?t=1788149082\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/7b9c85f739ab1189856e5022ebe80dcb.webm?t=1788149082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/7b9c85f739ab1189856e5022ebe80dcb.mp4?t=1788149082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Yes, you'll fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Probably a lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fortunately, strategically placed checkpoints mean you're never too far from your next attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dust yourselves off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Argue about whose fault it was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Then try again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/b09c93d8813d949e6fbef06959c4bafe.avif?t=1788149082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras_big/b09c93d8813d949e6fbef06959c4bafe.webp?t=1788149082 width=1560 height=146 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/92ce8e39a8e4af1dd0e069ef68182d18.poster.avif?t=1788149082\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/92ce8e39a8e4af1dd0e069ef68182d18.webm?t=1788149082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/92ce8e39a8e4af1dd0e069ef68182d18.mp4?t=1788149082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unique shared two-player tank controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Chaotic physics-based platforming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Online and local co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Full singleplayer support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Battle enemy tanks and automated turrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Deadly military-themed obstacle courses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Precision platforming that rewards teamwork</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Full contro