lass=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Want to move forward?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Push together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Need to make a difficult jump?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Time it perfectly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trying to destroy an enemy tank?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Aim first. Panic later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The controls are simple to learn—but mastering them is another story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/33bd58ff63fb203452e98fbf66222131.avif?t=1788149082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras_big/33bd58ff63fb203452e98fbf66222131.webp?t=1788149082 width=1560 height=146 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/0ab8a804772ed0e9a4096c6478ede9f2.poster.avif?t=1788149082\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/0ab8a804772ed0e9a4096c6478ede9f2.webm?t=1788149082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/0ab8a804772ed0e9a4096c6478ede9f2.mp4?t=1788149082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The military obstacle course isn't here to help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It's here to test your teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight your way through increasingly dangerous environments filled with:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Rivers of lava</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Massive swinging hammers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explosive minefields</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Slippery oil-covered roads</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enemy tanks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Automated turrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Precision platforming challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every obstacle is designed to push your coordination, timing, and patience to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every checkpoint feels earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every failure is hilarious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/c72c44e8c0db458436e2c711be524ad0.avif?t=1788149082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras_big/c72c44e8c0db458436e2c711be524ad0.webp?t=1788149082 width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/0b5e8c32557a53945c841e9eb1726fc3.avif?t=1788149082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras_big/0b5e8c32557a53945c841e9eb1726fc3.webp?t=1788149082 width=1560 height=139 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Team up with a friend from anywhere and conquer the chaos together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/d2fbed91a84dd14359fb13eabed9c1dd.avif?t=1788149082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras_big/d2fbed91a84dd14359fb13eabed9c1dd.webp?t=1788149082 width=1560 height=139 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Share the same couch, the same tank... and probably the blame.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/6ace6082db5363801718840a6a9b7dd9.avif?t=1788149082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras_big/6ace6082db5363801718840a6a9b7dd9.webp?t=1788149082 width=1560 height=139 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Think you don't need a teammate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Control both sides of the tank yourself and discover a whole new level of challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/c772d5ab895786c15ecc611e80872271.avif?t=1788149082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras_big/c772d5ab895786c15ecc611e80872271.webp?t=1788149082 width=1560 height=146 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/7b9c85f739ab1189856e5022ebe80dcb.poster.avif?t=1788149082\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/7b9c85f739ab1189856e5022ebe80dcb.webm?t=1788149082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/7b9c85f739ab1189856e5022ebe80dcb.mp4?t=1788149082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Yes, you'll fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Probably a lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fortunately, strategically placed checkpoints mean you're never too far from your next attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dust yourselves off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Argue about whose fault it was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Then try again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/b09c93d8813d949e6fbef06959c4bafe.avif?t=1788149082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras_big/b09c93d8813d949e6fbef06959c4bafe.webp?t=1788149082 width=1560 height=146 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/92ce8e39a8e4af1dd0e069ef68182d18.poster.avif?t=1788149082\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/92ce8e39a8e4af1dd0e069ef68182d18.webm?t=1788149082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/92ce8e39a8e4af1dd0e069ef68182d18.mp4?t=1788149082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unique shared two-player tank controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Chaotic physics-based platforming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Online and local co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Full singleplayer support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Battle enemy tanks and automated turrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Deadly military-themed obstacle courses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Precision platforming that rewards teamwork</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Full controller support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Designed to challenge your coordination—and your friendship </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras/6bdacee83a5ff9ce75207ce987544f29.avif?t=1788149082\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/extras_big/6bdacee83a5ff9ce75207ce987544f29.webp?t=1788149082 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Tank Mates is a chaotic physics-based co-op platformer where one or two players share a single tank to tackle a brutal military obstacle course. Coordinate, survive deadly obstacles, and try not to destroy your friendship.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/fb284776126e7680de5f5c852149d59f0e0285d5/header.jpg?t=1788149082", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/c7edf73f3e846db0606d28dfa6772ef91340b81d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788149082", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890170/c7edf73f3e846db0606d28dfa6772ef91340b81d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788149082", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 or newer/AMD Ryzen 3 3100 or newer<br></li><li><str